<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">
<p>Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},&nbsp;<br />
<br />
Thank you for getting in touch with the Qantas Customer Care team regarding your experience on your flight from {{{Case.Departure_City__c}}} to {{{Case.Arrival_City__c}}}.<br />
<br />
<strong>Our commitment to high standards</strong><br />
<br />
We want you to enjoy a smooth and relaxing inflight experience every time you fly with us, so I'm sorry to hear you were dissatisfied with the &lt;item&gt; onboard your flight.<br />
<br />
We place a high priority on both the quality and selection of food and beverages we serve on board, and our Food and Beverage team work hard to choose options that everyone can enjoy.&nbsp;</p>

<p><strong><em>If short haul flight refreshments only :</em></strong></p>

<p>For more information on our inflight dining options refer to our <a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/qantas-experience/onboard/inflight-dining/domestic.html?int_cam=au%3Ainflight-dining%3Aarticle%3Adomestic-and-regional-dining%3Aen%3Ann">domestic and regional dining </a> page.&nbsp;<br />
<br />
<strong>We value your opinion</strong><br />
<br />
Customer feedback plays an important role in our continuous improvement process so that we can provide you with exceptional service from start to finish.<br />
<br />
We are constantly reviewing our menus, so I want to assure you that I’ve passed your comments on to the relevant team.<br />
<br />
Thank you for taking the time to tell us about your experience — we look forward to welcoming you onboard again soon.</p>
